    "Add your +7 phone number before selecting receiving banks.": "在选择接收银行之前添加您的+7电话号码。",
    "After publishing, open the individual post and press Share. Your browser can open its share sheet or copy the link; you can also copy the page URL. Share that post with people who might genuinely care, so they can read the full context and choose for themselves.": "发布后，打开个人帖子并按分享。您的浏览器可以打开其共享表或复制链接；您还可以复制页面 URL。与可能真正关心的人分享该帖子，以便他们可以阅读完整的上下文并自行选择。",
