    "Both people must enable SBP, and the author must include it on the post. This limits access inside Money Nerds; it cannot stop an eligible viewer from saving or sharing the revealed phone number and bank link.": "两人都必须启用 SBP，并且作者必须将其包含在帖子中。这限制了 Money Nerds 内部的访问；它不能阻止符合条件的查看者保存或共享所显示的电话号码和银行链接。",
    "Browse {category}": "浏览{category}",
    "Browser language, country and privacy-choice cookies last up to 180 days; optional view-count cookies also last up to 180 days. Account, post, media, report, security-log and backup retention periods have not yet been fully documented. Request deletion or details using the contact below. Removing site content cannot erase blockchain records or copies held by other people.": "浏览器语言、国家/地区和隐私选择 cookie 的有效期最长为 180 天；可选的观看次数 cookie 的有效期也长达 180 天。帐户、帖子、媒体、报告、安全日志和备份保留期限尚未完整记录。请使用以下联系方式请求删除或提供详细信息。删除网站内容无法删除其他人持有的区块链记录或副本。",
