    "Check the recipient, amount, asset, network, and fees in the final wallet screen. A compatible connected wallet may handle the transfer directly. Other routes provide a payment request, QR code, or address to use in your sending app; wallet support varies.": "在最终钱包屏幕中检查收件人、金额、资产、网络和费用。兼容的连接钱包可以直接处理转账。其他路线提供付款请求、二维码或在您的发送应用程序中使用的地址；钱包支持各不相同。",
    "Check your SBP settings.": "检查您的 SBP 设置。",
