    "Choice and legal grounds": "选择和法律依据",
    "Choose a public nickname and explain what you want to do, what support would cover, and any relevant timing. Add your own images, a voice message, or a circle video if they help. Preview recordings before publishing and keep private documents out of your attachments.": "选择一个公开昵称并解释您想要做什么、将涵盖哪些支持以及任何相关的时间安排。添加您自己的图像、语音消息或圆圈视频（如果有帮助）。在发布前预览录音并将私人文档保留在附件中。",
    "Choose a supported post language or leave it unspecified.": "选择支持的帖子语言或不指定。",
