    "Choose at least one, or include a configured SBP option below.": "至少选择一个，或包含下面配置的 SBP 选项。",
    "Choose each receiving bank only once.": "每个接收银行仅选择一次。",
    "Choose each supported funding asset only once.": "每个受支持的融资资产仅选择一次。",
    "Choose the Solana wallet that will send this payment, then open Fund again.": "选择将发送此付款的 Solana 钱包，然后再次打开 Fund。",
    "Choose the closest category, rather than publishing the same ask across several. Starting from a category preselects it in the composer.": "选择最接近的类别，而不是在多个类别中发布相同的问题。从类别开始，在编辑器中预先选择它。",
    "Choose the funding options you want to use. Nothing extra is enabled by default.": "选择您要使用的资金选项。默认情况下不启用任何额外功能。",
    "Choose valid receiving banks.": "选择有效的接收银行。",
    "Choose where support can arrive": "选择支持可以到达的地方",
    "Choose your sending bank above to see its opening button and instructions.": "在上面选择您的发送银行以查看其打开按钮和说明。",
    "Circle video ready · replay it above before publishing.": "圈子视频准备就绪 · 在发布之前重播上面的内容。",
    "Clerk and sign-in providers use authentication and security cookies with their own lifetimes. Telegram uses short-lived sign-in transaction storage. A legacy session cookie may remain. A pending donation can be saved in local storage to recover a transfer you initiated; this is separate from optional view counting and is removed by the recovery flow or your browser's storage controls.": "职员和登录提供商使用具有自己生命周期的身份验证和安全 cookie。 Telegram 使用短期登录交易存储。旧的会话 cookie 可能会保留。待处理的捐赠可以保存在本地存储中，以恢复您发起的转账；这与可选的视图计数是分开的，并且会被恢复流程或浏览器的存储控件删除。",
    "Clerk returned an invalid sign-in URL.": "职员返回了无效的登录 URL。",
