    "Compare the final recipient address, amount, asset, and network in your wallet with the funding dialog. For SBP, check the receiving bank and the recipient name your bank displays before confirming. Stop if anything differs from what you intended.": "将钱包中的最终接收者地址、金额、资产和网络与资金对话框进行比较。对于 SBP，请在确认前检查您的银行显示的收款银行和收款人姓名。如果有任何与您的意图不同的情况，请停止。",
    "Contact Money Nerds": "联系 Money Nerds",
    "Contact Money Nerds using the email below. The operator's legal identity, address, applicable representative and any required privacy officer have not yet been verified for this notice. International transfer safeguards and a complete retention schedule also remain under review. This notice describes the service; it is not a claim that those legal requirements are complete.": "使用下面的电子邮件联系 Money Nerds。运营商的合法身份、地址、适用代表和任何所需的隐私官尚未针对本通知进行验证。国际转移保障措施和完整的保留时间表也仍在审查中。本通知描述了该服务；这并不是说这些法律要求已经完成。",
    "Contact and notice status": "联系和通知状态",
    "Continue on your phone": "在您的手机上继续",
    "Continue with a private email code, Telegram, or any enabled Clerk Web3 wallet. Every method maps to one durable Supabase-backed public profile.": "使用私人电子邮件代码、Telegram 或任何启用的 Clerk Web3 钱包继续。每种方法都映射到一个持久的 Supabase 支持的公共配置文件。",
    "Copy is unavailable in this browser. Select and copy the phone number below.": "复制在此浏览器中不可用。选择并复制下面的电话号码。",
    "Copy the number before leaving this page. Paste it in the bank and choose the recipient’s bank shown below. Nothing is sent automatically.": "在离开此页面之前复制号码。将其粘贴到银行并选择如下所示的收件人银行。不会自动发送任何内容。",
    "Copy the recipient’s phone number, then open {bank} using its button above or your installed app.": "复制收件人的电话号码，然后使用上面的按钮或您安装的应用程序打开{bank}。",
    "Copyright": "版权所有",
    "Country for this notice": "本通知的国家/地区",
    "Country notices": "国家通知",
    "Covered platforms must remove qualifying intimate imagery as soon as possible and within 48 hours after a valid notice under the US TAKE IT DOWN Act, and make reasonable efforts to remove known identical copies. Contact an emergency service if someone is in immediate danger.": "涵盖的平台必须在根据美国《删除法案》发出有效通知后 48 小时内尽快删除符合条件的亲密图像，并采取合理措施删除已知的相同副本。如果有人面临直接危险，请联系紧急服务部门。",
    "Create an ask people can understand.": "创建一个人们可以理解的问题。",
    "Crowdfunding": "众筹",
    "Crypto is optional while SBP is included for this post.": "加密是可选的，而本文包含 SBP。",
    "Data Protection Commission": "数据保护委员会",
    "Datu valsts inspekcija": "Datu valsts inspekcija",
    "Describe the next useful step and, when relevant, the amount and timing. Separate estimates from known costs. Do not promise an outcome you cannot control, imply guaranteed funding, or present a joke as someone else’s emergency.": "描述下一个有用的步骤，以及相关的数量和时间。将估算与已知成本分开。不要承诺你无法控制的结果，暗示有资金保证，或者开玩笑说别人的紧急情况。",
    "Destinations are saved to your Money Nerds profile and snapshotted on this post, so a later profile edit cannot silently change where an existing Fund button sends people.": "目的地将保存到您的 Money Nerds 个人资料中，并在本文中进行快照，因此以后的个人资料编辑无法默默地更改现有基金按钮将人员发送到的位置。",
    "Direct community support for real people and immediate needs.": "为真实的人们和迫切的需求提供直接的社区支持。",
    "Direct recipient": "直接收件人",
    "Direct settlement, zero platform commission, and a public service wallet.": "直接结算，平台零佣金，公益钱包。",
    "Direct support · experimental": "直接支持·实验性",
    "Direct transfers": "直接转账",
    "Do not attach intimate images, passwords, identity documents or wallet secrets. Identify the existing content using its URL.": "请勿附加私密图像、密码、身份证件或钱包秘密。使用 URL 识别现有内容。",
    "Do not upload identity documents, full medical records, home addresses, or bank statements. If context is useful, describe it without identifying details. Obtain consent before sharing another person’s story, face, or voice.": "请勿上传身份证件、完整医疗记录、家庭住址或银行对账单。如果上下文有用，请描述它而不识别细节。在分享他人的故事、面孔或声音之前先征得同意。",
    "Drag around the edge, or use arrow keys to seek five seconds.": "沿边缘拖动，或使用箭头键寻找五秒。",
    "ETH and USDT on Ethereum (ERC-20)": "以太坊上的 ETH 和 USDT (ERC-20)",
    "EU privacy rights may include access, correction, erasure, restriction, portability and objection, plus a complaint to a supervisory authority. GDPR scope depends on the processing and territorial connection. Optional storage requires the applicable consent rules. Illegal-content notices can be sent without an account. National consumer, fundraising and payment rules still require separate review; this country selection is not legal clearance.": "欧盟隐私权可能包括访问、更正、删除、限制、可移植性和反对，以及向监管机构提出投诉。 GDPR 范围取决于处理和地域连接。可选存储需要适用的同意规则。无需帐户即可发送非法内容通知。国家消费者、筹款和支付规则仍需要单独审查；此国家/地区选择并非合法许可。",
    "EXTERNAL_AUTH_SECRET must contain at least 32 bytes.": "EXTERNAL_AUTH_SECRET 必须至少包含 32 个字节。",
    "Each opted-in post keeps the receiving details saved when it was published. Changing your number or banks here affects new posts only; it does not redirect support on earlier posts. Turn SBP off and save to remove those earlier receiving details permanently.": "每个选择加入的帖子都会保留发布时保存的接收详细信息。在此更改您的电话号码或银行仅影响新帖子；它不会重定向对早期帖子的支持。关闭 SBP 并保存以永久删除那些先前的接收详细信息。",
    "Electronic signature (type your name)": "电子签名（输入您的姓名）",
    "Email addresses and provider IDs stay in Clerk. Money Nerds stores only the stable profile link needed for posts, comments, likes, and transparent funding history.": "电子邮件地址和提供商 ID 保留在 Clerk 中。 Money Nerds 仅存储帖子、评论、点赞和透明资金历史所需的稳定个人资料链接。",
    "Enable SBP and save your phone and receiving banks in Funding settings, then try again.": "启用 SBP 并在资金设置中保存您的手机和收款银行，然后重试。",
