    "INJ on Injective": "单射的 INJ",
    "If a transfer may already have gone wrong, stop sending and contact your bank or wallet provider through its official support channel. Reporting a post does not reverse a transfer. For ordinary setup questions, start with the": "如果转账可能已经出错，请停止发送并通过其官方支持渠道联系您的银行或钱包提供商。举报帖子不会撤销转移。对于普通的设置问题，请从",
