    "Latest": "最新",
    "Lead with the actual need or idea. Is it a drawing, food for a rescue animal, a prototype, or a deliberately silly experiment? Be specific instead of relying on a vague request for money.": "以实际需求或想法为主导。它是一幅图画、救援动物的食物、一个原型，还是一个故意愚蠢的实验？要具体，而不是依赖于模糊的金钱要求。",
