    "Pesuruhjaya Perlindungan Data Peribadi": "Pesuruhjaya Perlindungan Data Peribadi",
    "Plain answers before you post, connect a wallet, or send support. If a funding route is unclear, stop and check it first.": "在您发帖、连接钱包或发送支持之前简单回答。如果资金来源不明，就先停下来检查一下。",
    "Platform transparency": "平台透明度",
    "Playful asks, delightful chaos, and things that make life lighter.": "有趣的询问、令人愉快的混乱以及让生活变得轻松的事情。",
    "Post #{id}": "帖子 #{id}",
    "Post a meme, fund a need, or back an idea. Support moves directly between people across leading crypto networks.": "发布模因、资助需求或支持想法。支持直接在领先的加密网络中的人们之间流动。",
