    "Posts": "帖子",
    "Posts, comments, and linked funding activity stay attached to a stable public profile, while its nickname can change over time.": "帖子、评论和关联的资助活动会依附于稳定的公众形象，而其昵称可能会随着时间的推移而改变。",
    "Posts, comments, and transparent multi-network funding connected to {wallet} on Money Nerds.": "Money Nerds 上连接到 {wallet} 的帖子、评论和透明的多网络资金。",
    "Posts, comments, and transparent multi-network funding from a {provider}-authenticated Money Nerds profile.": "来自 {provider} 认证的 Money Nerds 个人资料的帖子、评论和透明的多网络资金。",
    "Posts, comments, their nicknames, attached media, and linked funding activity can be viewed on public pages. Receiving crypto addresses and blockchain transactions are public. Your sign-in email is not your public profile ID, but a nickname or wallet can still connect your activity to you elsewhere.": "帖子、评论、昵称、附加媒体和链接的资助活动可以在公共页面上查看。接收加密地址和区块链交易是公开的。您的登录电子邮件不是您的公开个人资料 ID，但昵称或钱包仍然可以将您的活动与您在其他地方关联起来。",
    "Preparing a single-use direct payment request…": "正在准备一次性直接付款请求...",
    "Previous": "上一页",
    "Privacy and country settings": "隐私和国家/地区设置",
    "Privacy rights": "隐私权",
    "Products, experiments, open-source work, and ambitious ideas.": "产品、实验、开源工作和雄心勃勃的想法。",
    "Profiles": "个人资料",
    "Profiles, posts, comments, media and linked crypto activity are public. Blockchain records may remain public permanently. Optional SBP details include a phone number and receiving-bank information; eligible signed-in viewers can reveal them when the relevant SBP settings are enabled. Those viewers can copy them. Do not publish identity documents, wallet secrets, medical records or another person's private information.": "个人资料、帖子、评论、媒体和链接的加密活动都是公开的。区块链记录可能永久公开。可选的 SBP 详细信息包括电话号码和收款银行信息；当启用相关 SBP 设置时，符合条件的登录查看者可以显示它们。那些观众可以复制它们。请勿公开身份证明文件、钱包秘密、医疗记录或他人的私人信息。",
    "Projects and personal goals that need many people behind them.": "需要很多人支持的项目和个人目标。",
    "Protect your next click": "保护您的下一次点击",
    "Protect your personal details": "保护您的个人信息",
    "Protect your wallet": "保护你的钱包",
