    "Public Money Nerds profile": "公开 Money Nerds 简介",
    "Public Solana account": "Solana 公共帐户",
    "Public URL or account": "公共 URL 或帐户",
    "Public and restricted information": "公开和受限信息",
    "Public blockchain visibility does not prove that every story in a post is true. Supporters should review context, profile and funding history, and risk before donating.": "公共区块链可见性并不能证明帖子中的每个故事都是真实的。支持者在捐赠前应审查背景、概况和资助历史以及风险。",
    "Public is not anonymous.": "公众不是匿名的。",
