    "Public {provider} profile": "公开 {provider} 个人资料",
    "Publish and share the post itself": "发布并分享帖子本身",
    "Published asks": "发布询问",
    "Publishing and moderation": "发布和审核",
    "Put your post where it makes sense.": "将您的帖子放在有意义的地方。",
    "Read before you fund": "资助前请阅读",
    "Read notice": "阅读通知",
    "Read the full post, public profile, and conversation. Look for a clear purpose and consistent context. Ask questions if something is unclear. Urgency, a compelling photo, or an old account is not proof; do not let pressure replace your judgment.": "阅读完整帖子、公开资料和对话。寻找明确的目的和一致的背景。如果有不清楚的地方就提问。紧迫性、引人注目的照片或旧帐户都不能证明；不要让压力取代你的判断。",
    "Read the safety guide": "阅读安全指南",
    "Ready to add SBP to new posts after saving. It stays unchecked in every new post.": "保存后准备将 SBP 添加到新帖子中。在每一个新帖子中它都保持未经检查的状态。",
    "Received": "已收到",
    "Recipient details are self-declared, not verified by Money Nerds. Bank transfers are not tracked or included in verified donation totals. Never pay if the bank shows an unexpected recipient.": "收件人详细信息是自行声明的，未经 Money Nerds 验证。银行转账不会被追踪或包含在经过验证的捐赠总额中。如果银行显示非预期收款人，切勿付款。",
    "Recipient-declared route; check the address before approving.": "接收者声明的路线；批准前检查地址。",
    "Recording could not start on this device. Try another device or upload a file.": "无法在此设备上开始录制。尝试其他设备或上传文件。",
    "Recording is not supported in this browser. You can upload a file instead.": "此浏览器不支持录制。您可以改为上传文件。",
