    "The granted camera is reused by default. Choose another camera here when you want to switch front, back, or external devices.": "默认情况下会重复使用授予的相机。当您想要切换前置、后置或外部设备时，请在此处选择另一个摄像头。",
    "The live camera preview could not play, but you can still finish the recording.": "无法播放实时摄像头预览，但仍可以完成录制。",
