    "mn_viewer is a random browser identifier used to reduce duplicate post-view counts. It is set only after optional storage is allowed and lasts up to 180 days. Rejecting or revoking optional storage clears that identifier and stops optional counting. Global Privacy Control is treated as a request for necessary storage only. No advertising or third-party analytics integration is added by this feature.": "mn_viewer 是一个随机浏览器标识符，用于减少重复的浏览后计数。仅在允许可选存储后才进行设置，最长可保存 180 天。拒绝或撤销可选存储会清除该标识符并停止可选计数。全球隐私控制仅被视为对必要存储的请求。此功能不添加任何广告或第三方分析集成。",
